An Authorized Store Subscription grants the subscriber a Commercial License to
use the official version of Storebench for Business Use during the
Subscription Period, subject to this license, the applicable store terms, and
any additional terms presented with that subscription.

Each Authorized Store Subscription covers Business Use by one individual. Each
person who uses Storebench for Business Use needs their own Authorized Store
Subscription or another Commercial License.

The Commercial License granted by an Authorized Store Subscription ends when
the Subscription Period ends, including when the subscription is cancelled,
expires, is not renewed, or is refunded. Business Use after that time requires
a renewed Authorized Store Subscription or another Commercial License. Work
completed during the Subscription Period does not need to be undone.

An Authorized Store Subscription does not grant any right to redistribute Storebench
outside the authorized store, sublicense Storebench, sell Storebench outside the
authorized store, or use Storebench's name, logo, icon, or branding for modified
versions.

